### Register coach
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "guillaume dep",
  "email": "guillaume.dep@example.com",
  "password": "bonjour123!",
  "role": "coach"
}

### Register player
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paul Dupont",
  "email": "paul.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "bonjour123!",
  "role": "player"
}



### Login coach
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guillaume.dep@example.com",
  "password": "bonjour123!"
}

### Login player
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "paul.dupont@example.com",
  "password": "bonjour123!"
}



### Logout coach
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Cookie: token={{coachToken}}

### Logout player
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Cookie: token={{playerToken}}